    "Had a very good",
    "sermon. I was",
    "much struck with",
    "one remark, that",
    "Christianity gives",
    "us, on this earth,",
    "rest in trouble,",
    "not from trouble.",
    "Nothing but my",
    "faith in the Lord",
    "Jesus Christ could",
    "have carried me",
    "through this, my",
    "terrible time of",
